            <ArticleTitle>[INFULGAN-OPTIMAL ANALGETIC DRUG FOR USE IN LAPAROSCOPIC SURGERY].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>9-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The experience of the application of 78 patients after various laparoscopic procedures was generalized. As perioperative anesthesia drug Infulgan (production of corporation &quot;Jury-Farm&quot;) was applyed. Appointment of Infulgan in standard dose ensured the achievement expressed analgesic effect, reducing the volume of injected opioids and frequency of adverse reactions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
